WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:12,390
What happened? Can anyone explain it? Is it because eating after the expiration date makes you feel bad?

2
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:14,530
Hey guys, I found a good thing

3
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:16,890
This stone is called the black primary space stone

4
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,730
Put it on top of the empty backpack

5
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:20,970
You can expand your backpack by ten storage compartments

6
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:23,410
Can you return my primary black space stone to me?

7
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:24,890
You can also compensate me with some supplies.

8
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:27,130
You exchanged it for two meat buns and a bottle of water

9
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:28,460
What a loss!

10
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,540
A message will do?

11
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:31,530
Don't play dead!

12
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:34,390
What does it mean?

13
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:37,880
A bottle of mineral water in a meat-sucking bag will give me...
